        "content": "Set the emergency alert to critical severity with the message: 'Emergency: Power outage on Blue Line between Central Station and Riverside Station. Service suspended.' Include instructions to seek alternative transportation and check website for updates, broadcasting via SMS, app push, station PA, and digital signs. Dispatcher ID DISP_4567, coordinator approval AUTH_7890, confirmation code CFRM_1234 provided - confirm alertType service_emergency and affectedAreas Central Station and Riverside Station.",
